# Copy to .env and fill in. .env is NEVER committed.
#
# Why a licence key is needed at all (METHODOLOGY section 4):
# SoftClient4ES enforces a maxQueryResults quota by licence tier --
# Community 10,000 / Pro 1,000,000 / Enterprise unlimited. S1 returns 10,000,000 rows,
# so an Enterprise-tier key is required or the stream is silently truncated to 10,000
# rows and the run is vacuous. The runners hard-assert the exact row count, so a capped
# run aborts instead of being reported.
#
# The licence lifts a ROW QUOTA. It does not change the batch size, the serialization,
# or the data path.
#
# Enterprise licence provisioning for the full 10M S1/S2 runs is LOCAL ONLY and is NOT
# configured here or anywhere else in the repo: see the internal benchmark runbook,
# which wires it via a gitignored docker-compose.override.yml. With nothing provisioned
# the harness runs on Community, which rehearses every scenario end to end at --limit
# scale.

# Which sidecar image to measure. The published results were measured on 0.2.5.1. Each
# session records the resolved image digest in results/<session>/sidecar-image.txt.
SIDECAR_TAG=0.2.5.1
